            "review_title": "Review at The Khôi's Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Elena Janney\nDenver, Colorado51 contributions\n0\nDelicious food in Vietnam\nJun 2025 • Couples\n*Food:** \nThe Pad Thai is a must-try, perfectly balanced and garnished. Tom Yum soup is bold and aromatic, while the Massaman curry is rich and creamy. Vegetarian options like Green Curry with tofu are flavorful and satisfying.\nDrinks:** \nOffers traditional Thai drinks, including iced tea and tropical cocktails.\n**Price:** \nReasonable prices for quality and portion sizes.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 12, 2025",
