            "review_title": "Review at The Khôi's Kitchen",
            "review_text": "almaveronica\nMarikina, Philippines9 contributions\n0\nGreat food\nSep 2023 • Couples\nThe place had great reviews so my husband and I wanted to try it out. It was still closed when we arrived at 4 pm so we had a massage in a spa just across (Zen spa, great massage). We were glad we waited. We really liked the food, the owner/chef and his wife along with their staff were very friendly. We had fried crab spring roll, steamed fish, pineapple fried rice, and iced vietnamese coffee. Delicious. If we come back to nha trang, we will eat there there again.\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2023",
